        <div class="TitanStripe StripeSlider"><div class="noSiteBounds"><div class="Freeform FeatureText New100 HeroZone TitanBlock"><h1>Milwaukee County
</h1>
<h2>November 3, 2026 General Election - Unofficial Results
</h2>
</div><div class="Freeform NoBottomMargin FeatureImage New100 HeroZone TitanBlock"><p><img loading="lazy"  alt="" src="/files/county/county-clerk/Pictures/Election21.png"  /></p>
</div></div></div>
