    <div id="topZone" class="siteAlertInsert">
        
        <div class="TitanStripe StripeGreyTexture"><div class="siteBounds"><div class="BoxStyle ElectionResults FeedReader Freeform New100 CenterZone TitanBlock"><p style="text-align:center"><em>Last Updated: <span id="reportTimeLocal">Nov. 2, 2026 7:23 p.m.</span></em></p><input type="hidden" id="reportTime" name="reportTime" value="2026-11-02T13:23:57.485-06:00"><script type="text/javascript">
			
			var months = [ "Jan.", "Feb.", "Mar.", "Apr.", "May", "Jun.", "Jul.", "Aug.", "Sep.", "Oct.", "Nov.", "Dec." ];
			function dateFromString(s) {
			  var bits = s.replace('Z', '').split(/[-T:]/g);
			  var d = new Date(bits[0], bits[1]-1, bits[2]);
			  var localOffset = 0; // offset is 6 hours for standard time and 5 hours for daylight savings
			  d.setHours(bits[3]-localOffset, bits[4], bits[5]);
			  var hours = d.getHours(); 
			  var suffix = (hours>11) ? " p.m" : " a.m."; 
			  hours = (hours>12) ? hours - 12 : hours;
			  var minutes = d.getMinutes(); 
			  if(minutes <10) minutes = "0" + minutes;
			  var formattedDate = months[d.getMonth()] + " " + d.getDate() + ", " + d.getFullYear() + " " + hours + ":" + minutes + suffix;
			  return formattedDate;
			}
			document.getElementById("reportTimeLocal").innerText=dateFromString(document.getElementById("reportTime").value);
			
			</script><div class="ResultsBox">
  <h3>Election Results Progress</h3>
  <p><span class="label">Wards counted:</span><span class="value">0</span></p>
  <p><span class="label">Total number of wards:</span><span class="value">521</span></p>
</div>
<div class="ResultsBox">
  <h3>Voter Turnout</h3>
  <p><span class="label">Ballots cast:</span><span class="value">0</span></p>
  <p><span class="label">Registered voters:</span><span class="value">510277</span></p>
</div></div></div></div><div class="TitanStripe StripeDefault"><div class="siteBounds"><div class="Freeform NoBottomMargin New100 CenterZone TitanBlock"><h2 id="MunicipalityStatus">Municipality Reporting Status</h2>

<p>There are 19 municipalities in Milwaukee County. Nine municipalities process their absentee ballots at a central location within the municipality. Absentee ballots for the other ten municipalities are processed at their respective polling locations.</p>

<p>The following municipalities use Central Count of Absentee Ballots (Wis. Stat. Sec. 7.52). Once the County Clerk/Election Commission&rsquo;s office receives the transmission of 100% of total ballots cast in-person at all polling locations within each of these specific municipalities, the website will indicate that 100% of the reporting units have reported.<strong> However, results are NOT complete until the county has received the reporting of all ballots, to include ballots processed at central count location.</strong> A checkmark indicates that the County Clerk/Election Commission&rsquo;s office has received 100% of ballots processed (in-person ballots AND absentee ballots processed at central count) for that municipality.</p>
</div><div class="Freeform Municipality Flex33 New100 CenterZone TitanBlock"><p><em aria-hidden="true" class="fa fa-check fa-lg">&nbsp;</em> <em aria-hidden="true" class="fa fa-lg fa-times">&nbsp;</em></p>

