  <p>
      *Wards Reporting: 0 of 4</p>*Votes will continue to be tallied until all ballots received are processed (in-person at polling locations AND absentee ballots processed at central count locations).  To determine which municipalities use central count, and whether the county has received 100% of a specific municipality’s unofficial results, see the <a href="#MunicipalityStatus" linktype="3" target="_self">municipality status</a> above.  This race is not complete until the unofficial results from the reporting units (in-person and absentee) that make up this contest are received.  To see the reporting units that make up this specific contest, click the <b>Expand/Collapse Totals by Wards</b> button below.
    

